      },
      "message": "fix(geometry): skip the DXF CLASSES section on import\n\nThe DXF reader refused every section it did not know, so an AC1015 file\nwith a CLASSES section failed. CLASSES holds class records and no geometry.\nThe reader now consumes it to ENDSEC; other unknown sections stay refused.\n\nFixes #3450\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
