      },
      "message": "fix(geometry): skip the THUMBNAILIMAGE and ACDSDATA sections too\n\nThe issue names CLASSES, THUMBNAILIMAGE and ACDSDATA as inert sections.\nAll three are now opaque: records are consumed to ENDSEC, and a missing\nENDSEC is a named error. Other unknown sections stay refused.\n\nRefs #3450\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
