      "committer": {
        "name": "Quintin Smits",
        "email": "qd.smits@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-23T07:51:20Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(geometry): refuse entity records in skipped DXF places\n\nA record with an entity name in OBJECTS (without the AcDbEntity marker)\nor in CLASSES, THUMBNAILIMAGE or ACDSDATA was dropped with no\ndiagnostic. The reader now refuses it by name. A hand-written AC1015\nfixture pins the import of a CLASSES and OBJECTS export against its R12\ntwin, plus truncation, mutation and object-limit cases.\n\nRefs #3450\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
